Site context:

# Controller menu labels (site context)

Labels only, as seen on the controller's screens. No values. Values from the curve screen never go in this file.

## Measurements screen ("Mittaukset")
- L1 Menovesi - L1 supply water temperature
- Ulkolämpö - outdoor temperature
- L2 Menovesi - L2 supply water temperature

## L1 supply setpoint breakdown screen
- Curve value
- Autumn drying (a correction term)
- Outdoor temperature delay (a correction term)
- Max limit
- Min limit

## Plant
- Two heating circuits, L1 and L2, one outdoor sensor
